  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RMFB Rights of Minorities of Faith &amp; Belief</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is an effort to protect rights of religious minorities by coordinating with civil society organizations and faith actors to ensure equal citizenship rights for vulnerable groups, particularly religious minorities and women.</narrative>
